WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.460
Ball's up, and we're under way.

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.040
Okafor, in the corner... Bang! Three!

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.740
Adeyemi picks his pocket! All the way... oh, he throws it down!

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.980
Baptiste says no! Get that out of here!

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.300
The Embers bench enjoying that one.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.420
Listen to this place!

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.150
Reyes, step back... got it!

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.080
Okafor, from deep, for the win...

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.440
Bang! Embers win it!

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:22.540
Unbelievable!

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:25.450
They're all over him!
